  "overview": "Incremental Backup to File turns a Pipeline into a scheduled, file-based backup. The Create Backup Executables quick action builds it for you — one #Batch Executable per selected object, logging each object's data to file without writing changes. Snapshots download as CSV or JSON, and records restore straight from the logs.",
